              <ul class="space-y-1.5 border-t border-slate-800/50 pt-3 text-xs text-slate-400"><li class="flex items-start"><span class="mr-2 text-teal-400">•</span><span>Systems dynamics · Scenario modeling</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="mr-2 text-teal-400">•</span><span>Pure SVG + React (no dependencies)</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="mr-2 text-teal-400">•</span><span>Macroeconomic feedback loop exploration</span></li></ul>
